cards.body:
Every year the bank assesses the training needs of each person heading a senior management function and updates its **annual training plan** so that they stay competent. Under the consultation text the plan must cover:

- the **specific training needs**;
- the **learning methods**;
- the **period** by which training must be completed;
- an **annual review and assessment**; and
- a **CPD programme of at least 15 hours a year**.

Methods can mix on-the-job training, in-house sessions, seminars, conferences, further qualifications, product presentations, computer-based learning and one-to-one tuition.

**Records (FP-3.3):** competency standards, annual training plans, training material, attendance and evaluations, annual competence assessments and each person's CPD hours are kept for **at least five years** after the person leaves.
